        "original_id": "e4af2353-d053-54d6-beb9-393a722cc012",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Heidi Brunner, Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart\n- Places: Vienna, Prague, Estates Theatre\n- Works: La clemenza di Tito, Norma, La Cenerentola\n- Roles: Adalgisa, Annio\n\nFacts:\n- Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart's opera La clemenza di Tito premiered on 6 September 1791 at the Estates Theatre in Prague.\n- Heidi Brunner was born in 1966 and is a Swiss opera singer.\n- In Vienna, Heidi Brunner sang Adalgisa in Norma, Annio in La clemenza di Tito, and the title role in La Cenerentola.",
